export anchor CardMasonryStyle:
    number: 180
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Card masonry
    idea: Every piece of the dashboard is a soft paper card of its own height, dropped into masonry columns on warm beige, so busy projects get tall detailed cards and quiet ones stay a single line, with rust as the one accent.
    base: light
    palette:
        beige: #f4eee4, the page
        sidebar: #ebe2d3, the navigation column
        paper: #fffcf7, cards, fields and the current nav item
        ink: #2b231d, text
        muted: #665a4f, meta, eyebrows and notes
        line: #e3d8c7, dashed rules inside cards
        clay: #9a8670, field edges and last week bars
        track: #eadfce, empty bars and the ring track
        rust: #a3441f, the primary button, fills, this week bars, focus and the overdue card
        rustDeep: #7f3315, links, project names in activity and the current nav text
        rustTint: #f7e4d8, the urgent note and the avatar
        moss: #3a6a2c, On track
        ochre: #865700, At risk
        berry: #8e1f33, Behind
    type:
        Two stacks. Headings and figures use Iowan Old Style, Palatino
        Linotype, Palatino, Book Antiqua, Georgia, serif. Text uses
        system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial. KPI figures
        44px serif bold, the greeting 30px serif bold, card titles 19px
        serif bold, body 15px sans at 1.5, eyebrows 12px sans at 600.
    layout:
        A 232px beige sidebar holds a four block rust mark with the serif
        brand and six nav links with line icons, Home as a raised paper
        pill in rust deep. The main column has a top row with a pill search
        field, then at right a rust pill New project button, a round bell
        with a rust dot and a round initials avatar with Mara Okafor. Below
        everything is a card in CSS columns, three columns of about 280px
        at 1280px with 20px gaps, each card as tall as its content. In
        source order the cards are the greeting card with the date eyebrow,
        a serif greeting, a line about six projects and a rust tinted
        urgent note with a clock, then Website redesign in full with team
        eyebrow, status pill, bar, a facts list of due, days left and open
        tasks and the latest comment, then a solid rust Overdue tasks card
        with a big 4, then Mobile app 2.0 with a progress ring beside its
        facts and two recent events, then a one line Active projects card,
        then the Tasks completed chart card with rounded bars, then Billing
        migration with bar and latest event, then a Due this week card, a
        short Q4 customer survey card, the Recent activity card with
        initial discs, a one line Onboarding emails card, an Hours logged
        card noting about 31 hours per project, and a Spring catalogue card
        with only its numbers and the latest event. Below 900px the sidebar
        becomes a scrolling top strip, and below 640px the masonry is one
        column and the search takes its own row.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px card padding, 20px between cards and columns, 32px page gutter.
    density: Medium and uneven on purpose. A card carries as much detail as its project needs.
    corners: 16px cards, 10 to 12px fields, swatches and nav items, pills for buttons, search, status and the avatar.
    borders: None on cards. 1px clay edges on fields and search, dashed #e3d8c7 rules inside cards.
    shadows: Two soft warm layers on cards and the current nav item, 0 1px 2px and 0 6px 18px in brown at 6 to 7 percent.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.8px stroke at text size. Status sits in a
        pale tinted pill with a filled shape and the word, a check circle
        for On track, a triangle with a bang for At risk and a crossed
        square for Behind.
    focus: A 2px rust outline offset 3px, following the rounded shapes. A focused field gets a rust border as well.
    tone: Warm and conversational, such as 4 tasks are overdue, start there.
